{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":22,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["论耶路撒冷的信息"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["论异象谷的默示：",{"text":"有什么事使你这满城的人都上房顶呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你这满处呐喊、大有喧哗的城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"欢乐的邑啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你中间被杀的并不是被刀杀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不是因打仗死亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你所有的官长一同逃跑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都为弓箭手所捆绑。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你中间一切被找到的都一同被捆绑；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们本是逃往远方的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我说：你们转眼不看我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要痛哭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要因我众民","poem":1},{"noteId":17},{"text":"的毁灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就竭力安慰我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为主—万军之耶和华使「异象谷」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有溃乱、践踏、烦扰的日子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城被攻破，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀声达到山间。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以拦带着箭袋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"还有坐战车的和马兵；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吉珥揭开盾牌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你嘉美的谷遍满战车，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也有马兵在城门前排列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他去掉犹大的遮盖。","poem":1},"那日，你就仰望林库内的军器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你们看见大卫城的破口很多，便聚积下池的水，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["又数点耶路撒冷的房屋，将房屋拆毁，修补城墙，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["又在两道城墙中间挖一个聚水池可盛旧池的水，却不仰望做这事的主，也不顾念从古定这事的。"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"当那日，主—万军之耶和华叫人哭泣哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"头上光秃，身披麻布。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁知，人倒欢喜快乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宰牛杀羊，吃肉喝酒，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们吃喝吧！因为明天要死了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华亲自默示我说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这罪孽直到你们死，断不得赦免！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主—万军之耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["对舍伯那的警告"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["主—万军之耶和华这样说：「你去见掌银库的，就是家宰舍伯那，对他说："]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["『你在这里做什么呢？有什么人竟在这里凿坟墓，就是在高处为自己凿坟墓，在磐石中为自己凿出安身之所？"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["看哪，耶和华必像大有力的人，将你紧紧缠裹，竭力抛去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["他必将你滚成一团，抛在宽阔之地，好像抛球一样。你这主人家的羞辱，必在那里坐你荣耀的车，也必在那里死亡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我必赶逐你离开官职；你必从你的原位撤下。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["「到那日，我必召我仆人希勒家的儿子以利亚敬来，"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["将你的外袍给他穿上，将你的腰带给他系紧，将你的政权交在他手中。他必作耶路撒冷居民和犹大家的父。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["我必将大卫家的钥匙放在他肩头上。他开，无人能关；他关，无人能开。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["我必将他安稳，像钉子钉在坚固处；他必作为他父家荣耀的宝座。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["他父家所有的荣耀，连儿女带子孙，都挂在他身上，好像一切小器皿，从杯子到酒瓶挂上一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["万军之耶和华说：当那日，钉在坚固处的钉子必压斜，被砍断落地；挂在其上的重担必被剪断。因为这是耶和华说的。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":17,"caller":"-","text":"原文是民女","reference":{"chapter":22,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/22.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/23.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/21.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}